      "summary": "{@emma} asks {@jjajja} the names of things in her kitchen.",
      "lines": [
        "Grandma, what is this called in Luganda?",
        "That is a basket.",
        "Basket. And what is this?",
        "This is a knife.",
        "I don’t understand. Repeat slowly, Grandma.",
        "A knife. This is a knife.",
        "Why are you learning Luganda, my child?",
